sequenceDiagram
    participant Op as Operator
    participant CLI as loadweaver CLI
    participant Orch as ClusterOrchestrator
    participant Host as HostService
    participant WG as WireguardService
    participant RT as RoutingService
    participant Swarm as SwarmService
    participant Ceph as CephService
    participant Traefik as TraefikService
    participant Vip as VipService
    participant Node as Remote node SSH

    Op->>CLI: cluster init
    CLI->>Orch: runGuardedMutation cluster.init
    Orch->>Host: host.bootstrap all nodes
    Host->>Node: apt docker wireguard keepalived bird2 on hubs cephadm
    Orch->>Host: verify prerequisites
    Orch->>WG: wireguard.init
    WG->>Node: deploy wg0.conf keys peers
    alt routing.enabled
        Orch->>RT: routing.init
        RT->>Node: wg1 cross peers optional bird.conf
    end
    Orch->>Swarm: swarm.init + joinAll
    Swarm->>Node: docker swarm init/join on wg0
    Orch->>Ceph: ceph.init cephfs mount
    Ceph->>Node: cephadm bootstrap mount
    Orch->>Traefik: traefik.deploy
    Traefik->>Node: stack deploy CephFS volumes
    opt vip configured
        Orch->>Vip: vip.init
        Vip->>Node: keepalived.conf
    end
    Orch->>Orch: persist state.json
